{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_01",
      "hash": "f87cb4ed9d98299a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我啊……\\n真是太不擅长培育宝可梦了。\\c\\n这只小火龙也是，一直都弱不禁风的，\\n我自己看着都觉得它太可怜……\\c\\n因此，我想要把它托付给\\n比我更有水准的训练家。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_05",
      "hash": "f87cb0ed9d9822ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你所捕捉到的\\n宝可梦的数量为——\\r\\n[VAR NUM9(0000,0000)]只啊……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_06",
      "hash": "f87cafed9d98211b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真厉害！真想把这只小火龙\\n托付给你啊！你觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_02",
      "hash": "f87cb3ed9d9827e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那么就拜托你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_07",
      "hash": "f87caeed9d981f68",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我捕捉到的数量有[VAR NUM3(0000)]只。\\n你的数量起码要比我多吧……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_03",
      "hash": "f87cb2ed9d982634",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是吗……\\n那我还是把它传送给博士吧……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_04",
      "hash": "f87cb1ed9d982481",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那只小火龙你还在培育吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub038_poke_01",
      "hash": "a722653a024051d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小火龙：火龙龙～！"
    }
  ],
